BT /F2 13 Tf 64 742 Td (Scope) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 722 Td (This policy applies to everyone who uses Grevya systems, devices or data, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 707 Td (employees, interns and contractors.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 676 Td (Accounts and passwords) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 69 656 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 656 Td (Use Single Sign-On with multi-factor authentication for every company application.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 69 635 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 635 Td (Passwords must be at least 12 characters and must never be shared or reused across) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 620 Td (services.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 69 599 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 599 Td (Use the company password manager to store credentials.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 568 Td (Devices) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 548 Td (Only company-managed laptops may access customer data. Devices must have disk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 533 Td (encryption, automatic screen lock after 5 minutes and up-to-date security patches.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 518 Td (Report a lost or stolen device to IT within 1 hour.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 487 Td (Data classification) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 467 Td (Grevya data is classified as Public, Internal, Confidential or Restricted. Customer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 452 Td (data and employee personal data are Restricted: store them only in approved systems,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 437 Td (never download them to personal devices, and share them only with people who need them) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 422 Td (for their role.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 391 Td (Reporting incidents) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 371 Td (Report suspected phishing, malware, data leaks or unauthorised access to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 356 Td (security@grevya.com or the #security Slack channel immediately and within 1 hour at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 341 Td (most. Do not try to investigate on your own.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 310 Td (Compliance and exceptions) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 290 Td (Violations of this policy may lead to disciplinary action up to and including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 275 Td (termination of employment, in line with the Grevya Code of Conduct and applicable law.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 254 Td (Exceptions must be approved in writing by the People Success team and the relevant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 239 Td (function head. Approved exceptions are recorded in People Success and reviewed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 224 Td (annually.) Tj ET
